      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd much rather just portals have a collider and you open up your quick menu and select it and press \"preload\", much like how you would interact with other players. That way you won't kill people on datacaps, unless they make an informed decision to load it themselves.\n\nAlso you could pull up the world in your main menu also and find out more about it before you head in! Maybe even favourite it if they want to check out a dropped portal later! Wow!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
